// SGEMM kernel for C = A * B, NxN row-major single-precision matrices.
//
// Design for NVIDIA A40 (sm_80, Ampere):
//   - Register tiling: each thread computes an 8x8 micro-tile of C.
//   - Block tile: 128x128 (16x16 threads).
